Model: Ferrari 599XX EVO
Max Buyout: 1,100,000 CR
Execute the Macro:

Once the search parameters are set, execute the macro to initiate the automated process. The script will take care of navigating the auction interface, identifying relevant listings, and placing bids.

YouTube Tutorial: Refer to the linked YouTube video for a comprehensive tutorial on auction sniping using the script macro. This visual guide ensures a smooth and successful experience https://youtu.be/ngIJoIm3vF4

Embrace the power of automation and elevate your Forza Horizon 4 experience with the Ferrari 599XX EVO Auction Sniping Macro. Secure the fastest and rarest car in the game effortlessly and enjoy the thrill of high-speed racing in style.

